v 3
d convertanything. Multi-format importer and converter for Stata.
d
d Walks a file or a whole directory tree and converts every Stata-friendly
d format it finds (csv, xlsx, xls, and more) into .dta, mirroring the source
d tree, optionally importing every worksheet, cleaning variable names, and
d compressing. Turns a shared-drive drop of mixed formats into one clean set
d of datasets in a single pass.
d
d Requires: Stata 16+.
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
f convertanything.ado
f convertanything.sthlp
